# f6z_ms1 (f6 confirmation, PHercParis4 z 7000-8500, notes/2026-10-24-f6-confirm-prereg.md): METHOD A4 cut (autowind chains --raise auto, then autowind.postproc --mode cut --thr 0.263), weight 10, spacing 0, seed 1
# Shared by all f6z_* arms except ARM, REL_WINDINGS and FIT_OVERRIDES (= the f4_* lines; seed: optimizer_random_seed, villa default 1).
# Fit frame = level 2 of the 2.400 um volume 20260411134726 (9.6 um), organisers' bucket m7-L2-th0.2 (z 7000 band rows,
# local data/paris4_z7000/masks), public umbilicus / 4, sense CW. Same recipe as the p4_* arms except Z0/Z1.
SCROLL=PHercParis4
VOL=20260411134726
UM=9.6
SENSE=CW
ARM=f6z_ms1
Z0=7000
Z1=8500
MASK_TAG=m7L2
MASK_LOCAL=$HOME/data/PHercParis4/masks/m7_L2_th0.2.zarr
TRACKS_DBM=
